"from the recorded traits for this trial. If you are creating a seedlot for "
"each accession and select a trait or a computed value as their initial "
"value, then the sum of the trait values for each of the accession's plots "
"will be used. The contents of each seedlot can be modified in the table "
"below before its creation."
