msgid ""
"If you have a NIR band, you can calculate \"Normalized difference vegetative "
"index\", NDVI."
msgstr ""
"إذا توفر نطاق NIR، يمكنك حساب \"Normalized difference vegetative index\"، "
"NDVI."

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/manage_drone_imagery.mas
msgid ""
"If you have an RGB image, you can calculate \"Visible atmospheric resistant "
"index\", VARI, or \"Triangular greenness index\", TGI."
msgstr ""
"إذا توفرت صورة RGB، يمكنك حساب \"Visible atmospheric resistant index\"، "
"VARI، أو \"Triangular greenness index\"، TGI."

