msgstr "حل مشكلة دفعات البذور المفقودة"

#: mason/breeders_toolbox/trial/trial_upload_dialogs.mas
msgid ""
"Submit your trial again. You should have corrected all errors by now, but if "
"not please take a look at the errors in the red box below. You can continue "
"to modify your file and then click Upload until it works."
msgstr ""
