msgid ""
"Once you have created and downloaded your Field Layout and Trait files, move "
"them onto your mobile device into the Field Book directories (generally /"
"fieldbook/import_field/ for your Field Layout Files and /fieldbook/traits/ "
"for your trait files.)"
