#: mason/secretom/secretary/instructions.mas
#, perl-brace-format
msgid ""
"{span}SecreTary{end_span} is mainly trained and tested on the plant "
"secretome that has been identified through functional screens including a "
"yeast secretion trap."
msgstr ""
"دُربت أداة {span}SecreTary{end_span} واختُبرت أساساً على السيكريتوم النباتي "
"الذي حُدد بفحوص وظيفية تشمل مصيدة الإفراز في الخميرة."

#: mason/secretom/secretary/instructions.mas
